        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions #1D Large Rope Door Handle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nStunning design door pull handle from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of Rope handle with decorative 2-1/2\" large ball finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors.  Great for large entry glass doors or heavy solid wood doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis entry door handle is assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for high quality innovational door pull designs. Available in 25.5\" or 30\" lengths and 11 different finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions #1D Large Rope Front Door Handle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Rope Style Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 standard lengths.</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-1DA:  Total Length 25.5\", Center to Center Mount 10\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-1DB: Total Length 30\", Center to Center Mount 16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 5 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts thru the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ball and Rope Door Handle, First Impressions #1DA",
                "description": "First Impressions # 1 Decorative Door Pulls. Stunning design door pull handle from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of Rope handle with decorative large ball finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors.  Great for large entry glass doors or heavy solid wood doors.  Available in 25 and 30 inch lengths and 11 different finish colors.",
